# Build inputs only. Anything else in the context is uploaded to the daemon on every
# build and can land in an intermediate layer and the build cache — including a local
# syspractice.db, which holds emails, password hashes and live session rows.
#
# Every pattern is `**/`-prefixed on purpose. A bare `*.db` only matches at the root of
# the context, so `backend/syspractice.db` sailed straight through it.
.git
.claude
**/.DS_Store
**/.env*
backend/target
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/*.tsbuildinfo
